    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Wicklow Homes are delighted to present this beautiful 3 Bedroom,3 Bathroom Family Home in the heart of the well established and highly sought after development in Woodstock Kilcoole Co.Wicklow.\r\n\r\nThe property consists of entrance hall leading to large siting room with open fire, double doors leading to kitchen/Dining Room. Ground floor guest WC. Double glass doors leading from kitchen to the bright and sunny paved back garden with fully wired and insulated Garden Shed.This has the potential to be converted into a work from home office space. The side entrance is covered and has a washing line for all weather clothes drying and storage.\r\n\r\nUpstairs leads to family bathroom,2 Double bedrooms,Master Bedroom with fitted wardrobes and en suite.Storage cupboard in the hall and attic access (that has potential to be converted in future subject to planning\r\n\r\nWoodstock, built by Tower Homes circa 2004, is a well-established and family-friendly development of approximately 100 homes, with generous green spaces and open layout. Kilcoole village is just a short stroll away, offering a range of shops, cafés, schools, and everyday conveniences. The nearby train station provides regular commuter services, while the beach lies approximately 1.8km from the property. The L2 bus route offers easy connectivity to Greystones, where further amenities including the DART station and park-and-ride facilities can be found just a short drive away"
      },
